  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported four single/batch steel-design record overloads and GetGoverningMember with complete matching XML IntelliSense. Added editable detached steel/member grouping metadata and a named Fx/My/Mz force model preserving only reported components. Qualified native success, written outputs, explicit PASS/FAIL text, unique critical-case identity and bounded ordered input snapshots. Composed current same-wrapper Load reads under one operation lease. Added stable governing selection with unavailable-ratio rejection and qualified managed population, preserving callback failure limits. See the steel-design record guide for contracts and qualification limits.",
